{"id":"rdb-cf0385","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-cde6f029-b202-44a9-94a0-dc784aa6736f","text":"Implementation complete in `7bcdc66`.\n\n**Changes in `engine/catalog.go`:**\n- Added `schemaDirty` flag to `tableState`\n- Implemented `AddColumn`, `DropColumn`, `ModifyColumn` on `table` (sql.AlterableTable interface)\n- Fixed journal commit path to send schema bytes when `schemaDirty` (not just for new tables)\n- Fixed native-git commit path to re-encode schema when `schemaDirty`\n- Added compile-time assertion `var _ sql.AlterableTable = (*table)(nil)`\n\n**Changes in `engine/engine_test.go`:**\n- Added `openEngine` helper to reduce boilerplate\n- 12 new tests: AddColumn, AddColumnFirst, AddColumnAfter, AddNotNullRejectsWithRows, AddNotNullEmptyTable, DropColumn, DropPKColumnRejected, ModifyColumnType, ModifyPKTypeRejected, RenameColumn, PersistsThroughReopen (journal), PersistsNativeGit\n\nAll 14 test packages pass. No decisions outside the spec."},"created_at":"2026-09-14T07:59:38.536197Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.270 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
{"id":"rdb-cf0385","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-ce2ef787-572d-47e6-9fc8-f0986ddf0d72","text":"Fixed three correctness issues in `f992be9`:\n\n1. **Row width corruption** — Reordering now uses clean remove-then-insert on both schema and rows. Old code allocated intermediate row at original length then created a final row one element longer.\n2. **Wrong destination when moving right** — `MODIFY b AFTER c` on `(a,b,c)` now correctly produces `(a,c,b)`. Old code computed insertion point in original schema instead of the reduced schema.\n3. **Silent narrowing** — `column.Type.Convert` inRange flag is now checked. Narrowing a BIGINT(99999) to TINYINT is rejected instead of silently truncating.\n\nFour new tests added: ModifyColumnFirst, ModifyColumnAfter, narrowing conversion rejection, and reorder persistence through engine reopen.\n\n16 ALTER TABLE tests pass, full suite green."},"created_at":"2026-09-14T08:07:06.060244Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.270 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
{"id":"rdb-cf0385","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-0a0f26ff-1dc3-4fd7-9eca-e85e5e81f8f5","text":"Fixed two remaining blockers in `c25371f`:\n\n1. **Unsupported types** — AddColumn and ModifyColumn now call `validateSchema` instead of only checking AutoIncrement/Default/Generated. Adding or modifying to a DATE, TIMESTAMP, or any type not in `decodeType` is now rejected before it can corrupt the persisted schema.\n2. **Nullable-to-NOT-NULL with existing NULLs** — ModifyColumn now scans existing rows when tightening nullability. If any row has NULL in the target column, the ALTER is rejected.\n\nFour new regression tests. 20 ALTER TABLE tests total, full suite green."},"created_at":"2026-09-14T08:16:05.937185Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.270 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
