{"id":"rdb-160131","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-edf05737-5651-497f-bb4a-b19a9290aa34","text":"Implementation complete. All tests pass (full suite, zero regressions).\n\n**Changes:**\n\n`engine/catalog.go`:\n- `decodeType()` handles `Type_JSON` → `types.JSON`\n- `rawValue()` serializes `sql.JSONWrapper` via `types.JsonToMySqlString()`\n- `decodeRow()` deserializes JSON strings via `types.JSON.Convert()`\n- Added a comment on `decodeType()` noting the per-type switch pattern as a future cleanup candidate (type registry)\n\n`engine/engine_test.go`:\n- 7 new tests: DDL, insert/select round-trip (objects, arrays, strings), `JSON_EXTRACT`, `JSON_OBJECT`, invalid JSON rejection, nullable, persistence through reopen\n\nNo decisions diverged from the spec. No changes to `sqlLiteral` were needed — JSON values are passed as strings by callers."},"created_at":"2026-09-14T14:27:26.684488Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.270 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
